1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,505
Its uses: mass propagation of banana, orchids, potato and sugarcane, in commercial labs right here in Kathmandu and Chitwan.

2
00:00:09,505 --> 00:00:11,679
Virus free seed potato.

3
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:15,312
Storing germplasm frozen in liquid nitrogen.

4
00:00:15,312 --> 00:00:23,281
And every genetically engineered plant must pass through tissue culture, to turn one changed cell into a whole plant.

5
00:00:23,281 --> 00:00:29,583
Its limits: cost, skill, contamination, and unwanted somaclonal variation.

